# A1/A1.1/A1_08_places_and_directions.letz
# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Lesson 8"
#   https://quizlet.com/_h2svv7
# All @word and @sentence content is taken verbatim from the Quizlet flashcards.
# Distractor tokens are sourced from other entries within this same Quizlet set.

@lesson A1.08 "Places & Directions"

# --- Place nouns (Quizlet cards 1-12) ---
@word en Haus, d'Haus (n), Haiser (pl) = house, houses
@word e Gebai, d'Gebai (n), Gebaier (pl) = building, buildings
@word e Buttek, de Buttek (m), Butteker (pl) = shop, shops
@word eng Gemeng, d'Gemeng (f), Gemengen (pl) = commune, communes
@word en Theater, den Theater (m), Theateren (pl) = theatre, theatres
@word eng Kierch, d'Kierch (f), Kierchen (pl) = church, churches
@word eng Schoul, d'Schoul (f), Schoulen (pl) = school, schools
@word eng Bréck, d'Bréck (f), Brécken (pl) = bridge, bridges
@word e Kino, de Kino (m), Kinoen (pl) = cinema, cinemas
@word eng Klinick, d'Klinick (f), Klinicken (pl) = hospital, hospitals
@word eng Apdikt, d'Apdikt (f), Apdikten (pl) = pharmacy, pharmacies
@word e Café, de Café (m), Caféen (pl) = café, cafés

# --- Directional phrases (Quizlet cards 35-40) ---
@word laanscht de Kleederrayon = past the clothing aisle
@word de Rez-de-chaussée = the ground floor
@word den éischte Stack = the first floor
@word Richtung Mamer = in the direction of Mamer
@word op der rietser Säit = on the right hand side
@word op der lénker Säit = on the left hand side

# --- Sentences (Quizlet cards 13-34) ---

@sentence
@lu De Restaurant ass niewent der Kierch.
@en The restaurant is next to the church.
@distractor-en school, schools
@distractor-en bridge, bridges
@distractor-lu Schoul
@distractor-lu Bréck

@sentence
@lu D'Emma ass an der Schoul.
@en Emma is in school.
@distractor-en church, churches
